  "author_or_actor_if_available": null,
  "snippet_primary": "\"With Share &amp; Save, you can save on Etsy fees when you drive your own traffic to your shop and listings. Once you enroll in Share &amp; Save, if a buyer places an order within 30 days of clicking a link you've shared, you get an instant refund of 4% off the eligible order total from your Etsy Payment account balance.\"",
